                        Caching
                        Read replicas
                        Async processing

Level 3:
      100M users:
                  Introduce:                  
                              Partitioning
                              Sharding
                              Kafka
                              Distributed cache
                              Search cluster
                              Service decomposition

Level 4:
      Global users:
                  Introduce:      
                        Multi-region
                        Geo-routing
                        Replication
